<title>USA: Thomas Nelson seeks partner to expand music unit.</title>
<headline>Thomas Nelson seeks partner to expand music unit.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thomas Nelson Inc said Friday that it is reviewing options for its music division, including seeking a joint venture partner to provide assistance for expansion into the general market.</p>
<p>Thomas Nelson publishes books and music emphasizing Christian, inspirational and &quot;family values&quot; themes.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
